      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a818ac10931b09b7",
      "translationZh": "CodeGemma 是 Gemma 的一个专门面向代码的开放访问版本系列，我们很高兴能与 Google 合作发布它，让尽可能多的人能够方便地使用它。🤗",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2f729f1001df3e6",
      "translationZh": "CodeGemma 有三种版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cfb72544338f3a11",
      "translationZh": "一个专门用于填充和开放式生成的 2B 基础模型。",
