    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cfd6a1da048385a",
      "translationZh": "下表摘自原始报告，按语言给出了细分数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e283de02e19f9df0",
      "translationZh": "提示词格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff1a216d6f08e826",
      "translationZh": "CodeGemma 2B 和 CodeGemma 7B 使用填充（代码、注释、文档字符串、导入语句）来进行代码补全。CodeGemma 使用中间填充（fill-in-the-middle，FIM）目标进行训练以完成此任务，其中你需要提供前缀和后缀作为补全的上下文。以下词元用于分隔输入的不同部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "99282db5eac6ae31",
      "translationZh": "<|fim_prefix|> 位于我们想要执行的补全之前的上下文前面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c424d2ae26d4873",
      "translationZh": "<|fim_suffix|> 位于后缀之前。你必须将此词元放在编辑器中光标所在的确切位置，因为这就是模型将进行代码补全的位置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba8554a26e5f9463",
      "translationZh": "<|fim_middle|> 是引导模型执行生成的提示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a62c4c93de4407f4",
      "translationZh": "除了这些词元，还有 <|file_separator|>，它用于提供多文件上下文。我们将在“使用 transformers”一节中展示使用示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53779a59ffbcdd6b",
      "translationZh": "CodeGemma 7B Instruct 使用与基础 Gemma 指令微调版本相同的提示格式，遵循以下对话结构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1172a88bb16f42cd",
      "translationZh": "与 Gemma 一样，复现此格式最简单的方法是使用 transformers 中提供的聊天模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0691b3d447319a7c",
      "translationZh": "使用 CodeGemma",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a2cc0673b1c4283",
      "translationZh": "演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3c88a39c334473b",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这个 Space 中或下方嵌入的聊天机器人中，轻松试用 CodeGemma 模型（70 亿参数！）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08eaf89e4149d8dc",
      "translationZh": "这个试验环境底层使用的是 Transformers 实现。你也可以复制这个 Space 供自己使用——它是自包含的，因此你可以查看源代码，并按自己的意愿进行修改！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "228f87e8a1d64a06",
      "translationZh": "使用 Transformers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123e318fd94df14b",
      "translationZh": "借助 Transformers 4.39 版本，你可以使用 CodeGemma，并利用 Hugging Face 生态系统中的所有工具，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce8cfcdc9e839a21",
      "translationZh": "训练和推理脚本及示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed89844584690c08",
      "translationZh": "安全的文件格式（safetensors）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c1cbffbd35e572a",
      "translationZh": "与 bitsandbytes（4 位量化）、PEFT（参数高效微调）和 Flash Attention 2 等工具的集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a327c4a3bb24935",
      "translationZh": "用于运行模型生成的实用工具和辅助工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35bdf50d18bf2e52",
      "translationZh": "用于导出模型以进行部署的机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a11e717ddfe4166",
      "translationZh": "与 Gemma 模型一样，CodeGemma 兼容 torch.compile()，可显著加快推理速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b0398f0ce8ac5b4",
      "translationZh": "额外福利：我们为你准备了一个 Colab 笔记本，你可以在这里一键试用该模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85ddf67cf3a8c47b",
      "translationZh": "要通过 transformers 使用 CodeGemma，请确保使用最新版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "623252a3314c8e33",
      "translationZh": "下面的代码片段展示了如何通过 transformers 使用 codegemma-2b 进行代码补全。使用 float16 精度时，它需要约 6 GB 的 RAM，因此非常适合消费级 GPU 和设备端应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e765fd80062b1a3",
      "translationZh": "请注意，<|fim_suffix|> 标记出现在编辑器中光标所在的位置，标明生成内容的位置。<|fim_prefix|> 提供光标之前的上下文，而其后直到 <|fim_middle|> 的其余内容则是光标之后的额外上下文。如果光标位于文件的开头或结尾，这两部分中的任一部分都可以为空。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9e5e033c28f1f4c",
      "translationZh": "前面的代码可能会返回类似以下的内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccdcef139b0cc8ff",
      "translationZh": "请注意正确补全之后的额外内容。CodeGemma 7B 尤其如此，它的输出更冗长，往往会在补全之后提供额外的代码或注释。在进行代码填充时，我们必须忽略 FIM 标记或 EOS 标记之后出现的所有内容。使用 transformers 时，我们可以向 generate 函数提供一个终止符列表，提前停止生成，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be212746e016fc6f",
      "translationZh": "在这种情况下，一旦遇到第一个分隔符，生成就会停止：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0b9ba5903c0f6316",
      "translationZh": "关于精度的说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4585f27a6765ea55",
      "translationZh": "原始 CodeGemma 检查点以 bfloat16 精度发布。如果加载模型时未指定 torch_dtype，PyTorch 会将它们向上转换为 float32。转换为 float16 完全可以正常使用，而且在某些硬件上，它可能比 bfloat16 快得多。为了获得最高精度，我们建议使用 bfloat16，而不是 float32。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f2be77695006375",
      "translationZh": "你也可以自动量化模型，以 8-bit 或 4-bit 模式加载它。以 4-bit 模式加载 CodeGemma 7B 后，运行所需的内存约为 9 GB，因此它可以在许多消费级显卡以及 Google Colab 中的所有 GPU 上运行。以下是以 4-bit 模式加载生成流水线的方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d6114c5fa16d561d",
      "translationZh": "与 Google Cloud 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05a75d6b2afdb6db",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过 Vertex AI 或 Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE)，使用 Text Generation Inference 和 Transformers，在 Google Cloud 上部署和训练 Gemma。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96529dd423d6cae0",
      "translationZh": "要部署 Hugging Face 上的 CodeGemma 模型，请前往模型页面并点击 Deploy -> Google Cloud。这会将你带到 Google Cloud Console，你可以在那里一键将 CodeGemma 部署到 Vertex AI 或 GKE，由 Text Generation Inference 提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84df0cdfe612365b",
      "translationZh": "你也可以通过 Vertex AI Model Garden 直接访问 CodeGemma。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "589193c6737c9d9c",
      "translationZh": "与 Inference Endpoints 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c968f3138034e71d",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Face 的 Inference Endpoints 上部署 CodeGemma，该服务使用 Text Generation Inference 作为后端。Text Generation Inference 是由 Hugging Face 开发的生产就绪型推理容器，旨在简化大语言模型的部署。它具备连续批处理、词元流式输出、用于在多个 GPU 上快速推理的张量并行，以及生产就绪型日志记录和追踪等功能，并以 Apache 2 许可证分发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36709cde2b065693",
      "translationZh": "要部署 CodeGemma 模型，请前往模型页面并点击 Deploy -> Inference Endpoints 控件。你可以在之前的一篇博客文章中了解更多关于使用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 部署大语言模型的信息。请注意，T4 不支持 bfloat16 格式，因此你需要选择其他 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9459e12f91695e9b",
      "translationZh": "其他资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c86a0119d5e288ef",
      "translationZh": "Hub 上的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e45669b2f1913d3",
      "translationZh": "代码排行榜",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "61f0614f7471de94",
      "translationZh": "技术报告",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "open-access",
      "briefZh": "开放访问",
      "explanationZh": "指模型可公开获取和使用，具体使用条件由其许可证规定。"
    },
    {
      "term": "infilling",
      "briefZh": "填充生成",
      "explanationZh": "根据已有上下文生成缺失部分，在本文中用于补全代码中间的内容。"
    },
    {
      "term": "base model",
      "briefZh": "基础模型",
      "explanationZh": "经过基础训练、尚未专门调整为指令对话用途的模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "instruct model",
      "briefZh": "指令模型",
      "explanationZh": "针对遵循用户指令进行调整的模型，本文中的版本可用于代码对话。"
    },
    {
